# Brand source artwork — the full-size originals the icons were cut from.
# What the app loads is committed: frontend/src/assets/brand/ and
# frontend/public/icons/. The originals are ~3MB of PNG, and a binary that size
# is in the history for good once it is pushed. Kept out until somebody decides
# it belongs in the repo under a name that is not the export default.
/frontend/logo/
